PrismLauncher is a free, open source launcher for Minecraft, forked from
MultiMC.  It allows you to have multiple, cleanly separated instances of
Minecraft (each with their own mods, resource packs, saves, etc.) and
helps you manage them and their associated options with a simple and
powerful interface.

Features include mod management from CurseForge, Modrinth and FTB,
automated Java installation, skin management, and support for various
mod loaders such as Fabric, Forge, Quilt and NeoForge.
